-- חוזר לבעלויות תשע"ב/2: תשלום פעימה ראשונה של תוספת השכר במגזר הציבורי
-- לעובדי הוראה
-- The first tranche of the public-sector raise for teaching staff of the
-- owners of secondary education: "tosefet 2011" of 2.25% from 1.1.2011, the
-- order its base is computed in, what it counts toward, the updated shekel
-- additions, the Ofek Hadash middle-school staff, and payment in September 2011.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `תשע"ב/2 תשלום פעימה ראשונה של תוספת השכר במגזר הציבורי`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, date (18.9.2011), reference number, addressee, and the lead-in: collective agreements of 25.1.2011 and 14.8.2011 provide for the first tranche, and this circular publishes how to carry them out; no rule of its own.

-- The corpus nests this circular differently from its page: the page's
-- section 2א has five numbered paragraphs, of which the corpus publishes the
-- third to fifth as sections 3–5, and section 2ב and 2ג as 5ב and 5ג; the
-- page's section 3 ("ביצוע תשלומים") is nested under 2ג(3). The citations
-- below use the corpus's keys and the comments the page's numbers.

-- Time is counted in school months of 2011/12 (common.l4: September 2011 = 1).

@desc Where a teaching employee's employment, or part of it, is, as sections 2א and 2ג divide it.
DECLARE `employment division` IS ONE OF
    @desc the three- or four-year upper division, grades 13–14 included
    `the upper division`
    @desc a middle school, the employee not yet moved to Ofek Hadash terms under the agreement of 25.12.2008
    `a middle school, not yet under Ofek Hadash`
    @desc a middle school, the employee moved to Ofek Hadash terms under the agreement of 25.12.2008
    `a middle school, under Ofek Hadash`

@desc One portion of a teaching employee's employment by an owner, as far as this circular asks about it.
DECLARE `employment portion` HAS
    `in the teaching-staff grade`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `employed by an owner of secondary education supervised by the Ministry` IS A BOOLEAN
    `division`                           IS A `employment division`
    `combined salary`                    IS A NUMBER @desc the combined salary (השכר המשולב) of this portion, shekels a month
    `tosefet 2001 amount`                IS A NUMBER @desc tosefet 2001 of this portion, computed on a base without tosefet 2008 or 2011
    `tosefet 2008 amount`                IS A NUMBER @desc tosefet 2008 of this portion, computed on a base without tosefet 2011
    `Ofek Hadash table salary`           IS A NUMBER @desc for an Ofek Hadash portion, the salary by the agreement's table on 31.12.2010, shekels a month
    `personal shekel addition`           IS A NUMBER @desc a personal shekel addition paid in December 2010 and still paid in January 2011 at least; 0 if none

DECLARE `raise action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the raise from 1.1.2011` HAS `raise paid` IS A NUMBER

§§ `1 תחולה`

@ref akn:art_1
GIVEN p IS AN `employment portion`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `this circular applies to` p IF
        p's `in the teaching-staff grade`
    AND p's `employed by an owner of secondary education supervised by the Ministry`

§§ `2 יישום תוספת שכר בשיעור 2.25%`

`the raise` MEANS 0.0225

§§§ `2א`

@ref akn:art_2__para_a
GIVEN p IS AN `employment portion`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 2א applies to` p IF
        `this circular applies to` p
    AND (   p's `division` EQUALS `the upper division`
         OR p's `division` EQUALS `a middle school, not yet under Ofek Hadash`)

-- Section 2א(1)–(2): from 1.1.2011, 2.25% of the combined salary, tosefet
-- 2001 and tosefet 2008; tosefet 2001 is computed first, on a base with
-- neither later addition, and tosefet 2008 next, on a base without tosefet
-- 2011. Those two are inputs, computed under their own instruments.
@ref akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_2
GIVEN p IS AN `employment portion`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `tosefet 2011` p IS
    IF `section 2א applies to` p
    THEN `the raise` TIMES (p's `combined salary` PLUS p's `tosefet 2001 amount` PLUS p's `tosefet 2008 amount`)
    ELSE 0

@desc A use a salary addition may be counted toward, as sections 2א(3)–(4) ask.
DECLARE `salary use` IS ONE OF
    `the minimum-wage top-up`
    `percentage additions computed from the combined salary`
    `tosefet 2001`
    `tosefet 2008`
    `tosefet Oz LaTmura`
    `erosion addition 2011`
    `promotion-grade addition`
    `the hourly value`
    `severance pay under the Severance Pay Law`
    `contributions to a pension provident fund, the study fund and the Dafna fund`
    `every other contribution or deduction customary on the combined salary`

-- Section 2א(3) (corpus section 3): not toward the minimum-wage top-up.
-- Section 2א(4) (corpus section 4): salary for every purpose, and toward the
-- percentage additions from the combined salary except the five it names.
@ref akn:art_3 akn:art_4
GIVEN u IS A `salary use`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `tosefet 2011 counts toward` u IF
    CONSIDER u
    WHEN `the minimum-wage top-up` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `tosefet 2001` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `tosefet 2008` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `tosefet Oz LaTmura` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `erosion addition 2011` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `promotion-grade addition` THEN FALSE
    OTHERWISE TRUE

-- Section 2א(5) (corpus section 5): the shekel additions rise 2.25% from
-- 1.1.2011 over their value on 31.12.2010, and the circular prints the
-- results.
@desc A shekel addition with the amount it stands at from 1.1.2011.
DECLARE `shekel addition` HAS
    `addition name`           IS A STRING
    `amount from 1.1.2011`    IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:art_5
`the updated shekel additions` MEANS
    LIST `shekel addition` "תוספת הסכם '87" 167.75,
         `shekel addition` "תוספת הסכם '94 (תגבור הוראה)" 150.85

GIVEN v IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a shekel addition updated from its 31.12.2010 value` v IS
    v TIMES (1 PLUS `the raise`)

§§§ `2ב`

-- Section 2ב: three new additions of the "Oz LaTmura" agreement of
-- 14.8.2011, paid under that agreement; further instructions to come. They
-- are named here because section 2א(4) excludes them.
@ref akn:art_5__para_b
`the new additions of the Oz LaTmura agreement` MEANS
    LIST `tosefet Oz LaTmura`, `erosion addition 2011`, `promotion-grade addition`

#ASSERT all (GIVEN u YIELD NOT `tosefet 2011 counts toward` u) `the new additions of the Oz LaTmura agreement`

§§§ `2ג`

@ref akn:art_5__para_c
GIVEN p IS AN `employment portion`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 2ג applies to` p IF
        `this circular applies to` p
    AND p's `division` EQUALS `a middle school, under Ofek Hadash`

-- Section 2ג(1)–(2): the Ofek Hadash table rises 2.25% from 1.1.2011; the
-- updated tables are the agreement's.
@ref akn:art_5__para_c__subpara_1 akn:art_5__para_c__subpara_2
GIVEN p IS AN `employment portion`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Ofek Hadash table raise` p IS
    IF `section 2ג applies to` p
    THEN `the raise` TIMES p's `Ofek Hadash table salary`
    ELSE 0

-- Section 2ג(3): a personal shekel addition paid in December 2010 and still
-- paid rises 2.25% from 1.1.2011, for "a teaching employee as said in
-- section 2ב above" — section 2ב describes no employee (F-2011-12_tashab_02-a).
-- The reading adopted: the employee of section 2ג.
@ref akn:art_5__para_c__subpara_3
GIVEN p IS AN `employment portion`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the personal shekel addition raise` p IS
    IF `section 2ג applies to` p
    THEN `the raise` TIMES p's `personal shekel addition`
    ELSE 0

@desc The section of this circular that describes an employee.
DECLARE `circular section` IS ONE OF
    `section 2א`
    `section 2ב`
    `section 2ג`

GIVEN s IS A `circular section`
GIVETH A LIST OF `employment division`
DECIDE `the employees described in` s IS
    CONSIDER s
    WHEN `section 2א` THEN LIST `the upper division`, `a middle school, not yet under Ofek Hadash`
    WHEN `section 2ב` THEN EMPTY
    WHEN `section 2ג` THEN LIST `a middle school, under Ofek Hadash`

`the section 2ג(3) cites` MEANS `section 2ב`

`section 2ג(3) cites a section that describes no employee` MEANS
    null (`the employees described in` `the section 2ג(3) cites`)
#ASSERT `section 2ג(3) cites a section that describes no employee`

@export default The monthly raise from 1.1.2011 one portion of a teaching employee's employment by an owner earns under circular תשע"ב/2
GIVEN p IS AN `employment portion` @desc the portion of employment
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the monthly raise from 1.1.2011` p IS
    `tosefet 2011` p
    PLUS `the Ofek Hadash table raise` p
    PLUS `the personal shekel addition raise` p

§§ `3 ביצוע תשלומים`

-- The page's section 3: the payments this circular gives rise to, from
-- 1.1.2011 on, are made with the September 2011 salary.
@ref akn:art_5__para_c__subpara_3__cls_3
GIVEN p IS AN `employment portion`, `months from January 2011` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `raise action`
DECIDE `paying the raise with September's salary` p `months from January 2011` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `pay the raise from 1.1.2011` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `the monthly raise from 1.1.2011` p TIMES `months from January 2011`
    WITHIN `month number` September
    LEST BREACH BY `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "section 3: the payments are made with the September 2011 salary"

-- akn:conclusions The contact line for questions, the sign-off and signature; no rule.

-- Worked examples; the salary figures are round placeholders.
`an upper-division portion` MEANS
    `employment portion` WITH
        `in the teaching-staff grade`        IS TRUE
        `employed by an owner of secondary education supervised by the Ministry` IS TRUE
        `division`                           IS `the upper division`
        `combined salary`                    IS 8000
        `tosefet 2001 amount`                IS 1000
        `tosefet 2008 amount`                IS 1000
        `Ofek Hadash table salary`           IS 0
        `personal shekel addition`           IS 0

`an Ofek Hadash middle-school portion` MEANS
    `employment portion` WITH
        `in the teaching-staff grade`        IS TRUE
        `employed by an owner of secondary education supervised by the Ministry` IS TRUE
        `division`                           IS `a middle school, under Ofek Hadash`
        `combined salary`                    IS 0
        `tosefet 2001 amount`                IS 0
        `tosefet 2008 amount`                IS 0
        `Ofek Hadash table salary`           IS 10000
        `personal shekel addition`           IS 400

#ASSERT `the monthly raise from 1.1.2011` `an upper-division portion` EQUALS 225
#ASSERT `the monthly raise from 1.1.2011` `an Ofek Hadash middle-school portion` EQUALS 234

#TRACE `paying the raise with September's salary` `an upper-division portion` 9 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `pay the raise from 1.1.2011` 2025 AT 1
#TRACE `paying the raise with September's salary` `an upper-division portion` 9 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `pay the raise from 1.1.2011` 2025 AT 2
